# Hidayah AI 🌙

Hidayah AI is an AI-powered Islamic companion designed to help Muslims strengthen their connection with Allah through personalized guidance, daily Quran reminders, prayer tracking, and Islamic habit building.

## ✨ Features

### 📖 Daily Quran Ayah
- Daily Quran verse
- Arabic text
- Translation
- Practical reflection

### 🕌 Prayer Tracking
- Track all five daily prayers
- Daily and weekly progress
- Prayer streaks

### 📅 Personalized Islamic Schedule
- Schedule based on user's routine
- Prayer reminders
- Quran reading time
- Dhikr and Islamic learning goals

### 🌟 Daily Good Deeds
- Daily Islamic challenges
- Habit-building activities
- Character development reminders

### 🤖 AI Islamic Assistant
- Personalized motivation
- Productivity guidance
- Islamic habit recommendations
- Reference-based educational support

### 📊 Habit Tracker
- Quran reading
- Dhikr
- Charity
- Islamic learning
- Fasting goals

